&lt;h2 id=&#34;duix-mobile-on-device-ai-powered-digital-human-sdk-for-real-time-interaction-androidios&#34;&gt;DUIX-Mobile: On-Device AI-Powered Digital Human SDK for Real-Time Interaction (Android/iOS)  
